I understand that it has been released.  Great news.
A couple of things:
1)  Could it be announced here on the list (alsa-devel).  A one-liner
would be nice.  I looked in the archive and only found references to
"non-compiles" indicating a new version.  I went to the ALSA site, and
a new version had appeared.

2)  Even nicer:  How about a bunch of notes that highlight the changes
since the last.  These could be posted on the alsa-project web site and
be helpful to all.  Hopefully we won't need the entire CVS diff, but a
summary would be nice.

Thanks!!  ALSA is the best.  I'll get the latest, and go from there.

